## Model card

- **Name:** Pareto 26.10 Preview
- **Short description:** Unbiased's current composite model (positioned "for research, coding and agentic work"): it runs several language models and synthesizes one answer, so there is no single upstream to compare it against. Newer sibling of the `unbiased/pareto` listing (262,144 context, $2.50/$7.50 — a separate, currently disabled row).
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter `unbiased/pareto-26.10-preview` (BYOK-only; Chat Completions API with `tools`/`tool_choice` accepted; also reachable through AnyRouter's gateway). No OpenCode Zen listing found this pass.
- **Release / knowledge:** Added to the AnyRouter catalog 2026-10-02 (release notes); knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `unbiased/pareto-26.10-preview` (OpenRouter). No Free ID on OpenCode Zen this pass.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 total; max output 131,072 (AnyRouter release notes 2026-10-02, citing OpenRouter; verified 2026-10-05).
- **Modalities:** text + image in, text out; tool calls; `max_tokens` / `temperature` / `top_p` control. No verified public reasoning-mode flags.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-05):** $0.80 input / $3.20 output / $0.03 cached input per 1M tokens on OpenRouter (BYOK; billed by OpenRouter).
- **Architecture:** Composite (multiple language models synthesized into one answer) — vendor: Unbiased; no single parameter count or license disclosed.

